{"ID":"20240205153708-30n73lr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153708-30n73lr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153708-30n73lr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115615-0loitfb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162852-kjmf930\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115635-1s2roey\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:125,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:125\u0026#125;","title":"棕榈","type":"doc","updated":"20240902093441"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206115635-1s2roey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115635-1s2roey","updated":"20240206115638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、云南、贵州、湖南、湖北、陕西等地区。\n【性状】\t本品呈长条板状，一端较窄而厚，另端较宽而稍薄，大小不等。表面红棕色，粗糙，有纵直皱纹；一面有明显的凸出纤维，纤维的两侧若生多数棕色茸毛。质硬而韧，不易折断，新面纤维性。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t苦、涩，平。\n【功效】\t收敛止血。用于吐血，衄血，尿血，便血，崩漏。"}]},{"ID":"20240206115626-3xp72en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115626-3xp72en","updated":"20240206115626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115626-za4s7dj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715140212-mzdo1su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715140212-mzdo1su","updated":"20240715140251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕榈 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕榈 19-20240715140248-drkw9q3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715134317-wso3tmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715134317-wso3tmy","updated":"20240715135309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 585px;","style":"width: 575px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕榈 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕榈 1-20240715134314-rf713cr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 575px;\" parent-style=\"width: 585px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕榈 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕榈 10-20240715135309-jw2f1p5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715135346-z8aea2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715135346-z8aea2e","updated":"20240715135526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 708px;","style":"width: 698px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕榈 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕榈 13-20240715135516-wpyy5n7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 698px;\" parent-style=\"width: 708px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 255px;","style":"width: 245px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"No